      "comment": "FLYING CAROLINE (7) goes very well this course and distance starting nine times for three wins and four minors. Was out of the placings last time (20.02) at this track in a Grade 4, finishing sixth and beaten 5.5 lengths. Expected to be in the finish. ZIPPING LARGO (3) is a smart beginner who has shown good improvement at her last two starts, the latest scoring at this track over 340m. Makes plenty of appeal on the back of that last-start win. BLACK HOAX (2) has been hard to follow lately, running fifth (19.80) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at this track. Can turn it around this time. INSPECTOR FRANK (6) will be hard to beat with a drop in distance.",
